newJitCallT -- S6 (SEQ 540): a call on the new road. Run plain it is the twin; pop.sh runs it under jitter; too. Every action builds on the new road, oc on the old. c* is the self-call, k* and t* the callee chain, h* a return riding up three levels, ma / mb mutual recursion. A local written and read around a call (t11), a callee that refuses (k7, cG), a callee with no return (k4, cE), and returns of a string and a number (k2, k3, cC, cD) are the shapes an i32 alone would read wrong.
